CORE
main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* set by the friend: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* reset: SUCCESS$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
N5008 [basic.lookup.argdep]/4.2: argument-dependent lookup finds a friend
function from the point of its declaration in the class.  A call in a member
function body, which is looked up after the class, failed when the function
was declared again at namespace scope after the call.
